title: 엔딩50_양나현_영문
---
<<bg 검은화면>>
(There’s a missed call from NaHyun.)
(I tried calling her back, but...)
<<play 공통_수화음>>
(The dial tone just rings endlessly.)
{name()}: Why isn't she picking up?
<<play 공통_긴웅성>>
(Today is supposed to be my third date with NaHyun.)
(I even got all dressed up, thinking, "Today's the day I finally confess!")
(There are only 5 minutes left until our meeting time, but NaHyun has gone completely dark.)
(I stayed at our meeting spot and kept waiting for her.)
(After about 10 minutes of waiting...)
(I hear NaHyun’s voice faintly in the distance.)
NaHyun: ...
(I couldn't quite make out what she was saying because of the distance.)
(I started walking toward the sound of her voice.)
{name()}: ...?
(I froze in confusion.)
<<hide>>
<<bg 양나현_일반엔딩>>
(NaHyun was walking, hand-in-hand with another guy, wearing the brightest smile I've ever seen on her.)
(Only then could I hear their conversation.)
<<play 양나현_웃음>>
NaHyun: Oh, [Other Guy's Name]! 
NaHyun: Thank you so much for telling me how you feel.
Other Guy: Of course.
Other Guy: Today is our third date, after all.
Other Guy: I knew I had to ask you out properly today.
NaHyun: To be honest, I was planning on confessing to you today, too.
Other Guy: NaHyun...
Other Guy: That means so much to me. I can't believe we were feeling the exact same way.
NaHyun: [Other Guy's Name]...
Other Guy: NaHyun...
(Unable to believe the scene before my eyes, I turned around and bolted.)
(How long had I been running?)
<<play 공통_벨소리>>
(My phone starts ringing.)
(It's a call from NaHyun.)
(With trembling hands, I answered the phone.)
{name()}: ...... Hello?
NaHyun: {name()}, where are you?
{name()}: ... I, uh... I suddenly feel really sick. I don't think I can make it today.
NaHyun: Oh... really?
NaHyun: Actually, I was just about to call and say I couldn't meet because I'm not feeling great either.
{name()}: ...... I see.
NaHyun: Don't push yourself, and get some rest today.
{name()}: ...Yeah. You too.
(After that day, I was never able to reach NaHyun again.)
(It turns out I was just another slow-moving fish in her crowded fish tank.)
(At first, I was furious. But once I realized the truth and accepted it...)
(I started to feel a bit better, thinking I'd dodged a bullet.)
(I heard that NaHyun and that guy are still happily dating.)
(......)
(If only I had captured her heart a little more...)
(Could I have been the one standing there...?)
<<wait 1>>
<<end>>
===